# AGENTS.md and language

- Read `AGENTS.md` at the start of substantive work on this repo.
- When you establish or change **project-global** facts (build, deps,
  layout, conventions, architecture), **update `AGENTS.md`** in the same
  change — not only in chat.
- Follow ponytail and communication rules defined in `AGENTS.md`.
- User-facing explanations: **Ukrainian**. Source code and comments:
  **English**.
- Markdown and git commit messages: **72 characters** max line length
  (see `AGENTS.md` → Formatting).
- After updating `CHANGELOG.md`, bump `version` in `pyproject.toml`
  (see `AGENTS.md` → Versioning and changelog).
